cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Ganymede: Recovery Intelligence System"
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  A combined risk and coaching system for lending and collections. The Risk Lens
  predicts early default signals and allocates agent effort by expected recovered
  value per agent-minute. The Coach Lens shapes the recovery conversation in real
  time, inside a latency budget measured from real call audio. One outcome loop
  retrains both. Every figure the project reports is generated by the pipeline and
  labelled with the kind of evidence behind it.
